      "id": "01-signin",
      "instruction": "Navigate to http://127.0.0.1:8069/ and sign in to Odoo with login admin. In the password field type exactly this text: {{env:APP_PASSWORD}} - type it literally, character for character; the harness substitutes the real password as it is typed. Never guess or spell out a password. Note: the app long-polls, so never wait for network idle; wait for concrete page state instead. After login, verify the Odoo apps menu is visible and report which user you are logged in as.",
      "skill": "s_8adef5",
      "params": {
        "v1": "http://127.0.0.1:8069/",
        "v2": "admin",
        "v3": "{{env:APP_PASSWORD}}"
      },
      "outputs": [
        "apps_menu_visible",
        "company",
        "logged_in_user",
        "login_used",
        "topbar_avatar_label",
        "user_email",
        "current_url"
